OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman on chemotherapy ineligible
OL,4,Afor cancer drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-five living with with
OL,7,Fincurable secondary breast cancer,
OL,8,Fwhich has spread to her liver and
OL,9,Fbones, has been told she cannot receive
OL,10,Fa drug that might prolong her life as
OL,11,Fshe is on her third round of
OL,12,Fchemotherapy.
OL,14,FNHS England has access to Enhertu, but
OL,15,Fonly for patients who have had one or
OL,16,Ftwo previous lines of chemotherapy.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
